            {
              "text": "Ch 21.6 in Heb",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " The word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came to me: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Son of man, set your face toward Jerusalem and preach against the sanctuaries; prophesy against the land of Israel ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and say to the land of Israel, Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": Behold, I am against you, and will draw forth my sword out of its sheath, and will cut off from you both righteous and wicked. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because I will cut off from you both righteous and wicked, therefore my sword shall go out of its sheath against all flesh from south to north; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and all flesh shall know that I the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " have drawn my sword out of its sheath; it shall not be sheathed again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sigh therefore, son of man; sigh with breaking heart and bitter grief before their eyes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when they say to you, ‘Why do you sigh?’ you shall say, ‘Because of the tidings. When it comes, every heart will melt and all hands will be feeble, every spirit will faint and all knees will be weak as water. Behold, it comes and it will be fulfilled,’ ” says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
