          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “And you, son of man, prophesy, and say, Thus says the Lord ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " concerning the Ammonites, and concerning their reproach; say, A sword, a sword is drawn for the slaughter, it is polished to glitter",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21.28",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "to contain",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and to flash like lightning— ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "while they see for you false visions, while they divine lies for you—to be laid on the necks of the unhallowed wicked, whose day has come, the time of their final punishment. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Return it to its sheath. In the place where you were created, in the land of your origin, I will judge you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will pour out my indignation upon you; I will blow upon you with the fire of my wrath; and I will deliver you into the hands of brutal men, skilful to destroy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall be fuel for the fire; your blood shall be in the midst of the land; you shall be no more remembered; for I the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " have spoken.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.21.32"
            ]
          }
        }
